/obj/item/paper/fluff/awaymissions/research/gateway
	name = "Gateway Memo"
	default_raw_text = "<b><h2>IMPORTANT MEMO</h2></b><br><br><u>02/14/2564</u><br><br>Alright, let's keep this nice and simple for everyone assigned to this Project. This is a gateway that Nanotrasen installed lately on this research station for our expansion, and exploration. However, let's keep this off the records, they blatantly lied.<br><br>It's sometimes connected to other gateway systems on other stations. Last week we got sent to an old rundown Nanotrasen station, we retracted due to power running short in their gateway room. We tried to contact Central Command about what we saw, but it seems they just blatantly ignored that part of the conversation.<br><br>Aside from that, I'll put it simple. We MAY get some stragglers coming from unknown lands that are connected to other stations that accidentally get sent to ours. We installed a small desk for us to process, and see the affiliation of the person. Notify Security if something seems off. We cannot take the chance."
